      "content": "I hear how deeply you are hurting and how the idea of \"letting go\" feels like a peaceful end to a painful life. Please know that the \"quiet\" you feel in the mist is a desperate hope for relief from the pain you cannot feel alone, and I want you to know that help is available 24/7 if you just need to talk to a compassionate human being.\n\nI am so sorry you feel hopeless and like death is the only \"escape\" from the constant pain you are facing today.",
